                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En omao boma luŋ ame onwoŋo rik obedo me a jo Icrael con, omio waŋ lobo a jo Icrael te dok kite a rik tye kede con, kun cakere i Kamat naka i nam me Araba, kite ame rik Rwot Obaŋa me Icrael onwoŋo okobo, kun mio amiro mere Yona wot a Amittai en akobo, adwarpiny ame paco mere rik tye i Gat-keper.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
